# The positive control for p6_tree_speed_fast's comparison with 1x (physics
# catalog plan, ruled 2026-10-06, "Relative to the page's 1x"): the same run
# with a 500 ms busy-wait planted in every frame at Max, outside physics
# (tree.html?nodes=300&seed=7&links=none&gpu=off&physics_speed=1&physics_plant_max_frame_ms=500),
# so Max runs fewer ticks a second than the page's 1x: this receipt asserts
# the comparison misses.
assert snap ready == true
assert snap physics-speed == 1
assert snap physics-budget-share == 0.5
assert snap physics-budget-margin-us == 200
click role:button Play physics
settle 2
assert snap physics-paused == false
click role:combobox Arrangement
settle 1
click role:option Free (physics alone)
settle 1
click role:button Apply arrangement
settle 1
assert snap layout == free
settle 10
mark-pace one-x
assert snap physics-effective-marked >= 0.001
click role:combobox Speed
settle 1
click role:option Max
settle 2
assert snap physics-speed == max
timing start speed-fast-slow-max
settle 30
timing stop
log-physics fast-slow-max
log-pace fast-slow-max
assert snap physics-speed == max
assert snap physics-effective-over-marked <= 0.99
assert snap finite == true
log p6 speed fast slow max control complete
